あ、本当ですか！ありがとうございます！
Oh, really? Thank you!

410
00:48:37,933 --> 00:48:39,153
ありがとうございます！
Thank you!

411
00:48:40,113 --> 00:48:42,673
今回綾堎さんに来ていただいたのは
The reason we invited Ayane-san today...

412
00:48:42,673 --> 00:48:51,273
あの、私、なんと、恐れ多くも、なんと「コンプレックス・イメージ」をカバーさせていただきまして！
...is because I had the honor of covering "Complex Image"!

413
00:48:51,433 --> 00:48:53,813
で、ありがとうございます！
And thank you so much!

414
00:48:53,953 --> 00:48:57,553
それに反応していただいたのがとても嬉しくて
I was so happy when you reacted to it,

415
00:48:57,653 --> 00:49:01,533
ぜひぜひコラボで歌わせていただけたら嬉しいなと思って、お呼びいたしました！
so I invited you hoping we could sing it together!

416
00:49:01,773 --> 00:49:03,273
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

417
00:49:03,673 --> 00:49:07,673
いや、来てくれるなんて思っていなくてもう時々が止まらないんですけども！
I didn't think you'd actually come, my heart hasn't stopped pounding!

418
00:49:08,733 --> 00:49:09,473
私もです！
Me too!

419
00:49:09,673 --> 00:49:12,913
今すごい心拍数が上がってます！
My heart rate is soaring right now!

420
00:49:13,773 --> 00:49:20,273
本当に、本当に素敵な歌声で、もう私ずっとこうやって聞いてよっかなって途中で思っちゃいました！
Your singing voice is truly wonderful. I caught myself wanting to just listen!

421
00:49:21,073 --> 00:49:22,753
いやいや、一緒に歌っていただいてありがとうございます！
No, no, thank you for singing with me!

422
00:49:25,173 --> 00:49:31,073
いや、なんかライブでこういうふうに一緒に歌えるとは思っていなかったので、
I honestly never expected to be able to sing together like this at a live show,

423
00:49:32,113 --> 00:49:38,333
えと、どうでしょう、こ、こういう大きいステージで一緒に、歌うのは嬉しいです！
so how is it... singing together on such a big stage? I'm so happy!

424
00:49:39,153 --> 00:49:44,573
嬉しいです。あの、そらさんは横浜アリーナが目標なんですよね！
I'm so happy. Sora-san, your goal is Yokohama Arena, right?

425
00:49:44,573 --> 00:49:45,473
はい！
Yes!

426
00:49:45,673 --> 00:49:46,053
はい。
Yes.

427
00:49:46,573 --> 00:49:50,313
いつか、その夢が叶ったときに、
Someday, when that dream comes true,

428
00:49:50,673 --> 00:49:52,793
ご一緒できたら嬉しいです！
I'd be so happy to join you!

429
00:49:53,033 --> 00:49:54,113
え、いいんですか？
Eh, really? Is that okay?

430
00:49:54,173 --> 00:49:55,933
いいんですか？いいんですか？
Is it? Is it really?

431
00:49:56,013 --> 00:49:56,713
はい！
Yes!

432
00:49:56,713 --> 00:49:57,933
約束します！
I promise!

433
00:49:58,673 --> 00:50:00,113
また歌ってくれるんですか？
Will you sing with me again?

434
00:50:00,258 --> 00:50:03,378
はい、もちろん です。とっても嬉しいです。
Yes, of course. I'm so happy.

435
00:50:04,398 --> 00:50:07,298
もう本当に、ずっとずっと聞いていた曲で、
Truly, I've been listening to this song forever,

436
00:50:07,298 --> 00:50:11,098
他の曲もめちゃくちゃ聴いているので…嬉しいです。ありがとうございます。
and I listen to all your other songs too... I'm so happy. Thank you.

437
00:50:12,528 --> 00:50:17,068
本当に大好きな方に、こう、チェキ会に来ていただけて、
Truly, having someone I love so much come to my cheki session,

438
00:50:17,208 --> 00:50:18,468
私感謝でいっぱいです。
I am filled with gratitude.

439
00:50:19,188 --> 00:50:22,048
今後ともよろしくお願いいたします。
Look forward to working with you in the future.

440
00:50:22,228 --> 00:50:25,928
また、なんかコラボとかできたらとっても嬉しいなと思います。
I'd be so happy if we could do a collab again sometime.

441
00:50:26,508 --> 00:50:28,188
ぜひよろしくお願いいたします。
I'd love that, please look forward to it.

442
00:50:28,348 --> 00:50:29,868
よろしくお願いいたします。
Please look forward to it.

443
00:50:30,518 --> 00:50:35,978
改めまして、そらさんお誕生日おめでとうございます！ありがとうございます！
Once again, Sora-san, happy birthday! Thank you so much!

444
00:50:39,288 --> 00:50:45,908
と いうことで、本日はやねさんに来ていただきました！本当に本当にありがとうございます！
So, today we had Yane-san come join us! Thank you so, so much!

445
00:50:46,368 --> 00:50:46,908
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

446
00:50:57,950 --> 00:50:59,570
緊張した〜
I was so nervous~

447
00:51:02,010 --> 00:51:03,530
緊張したよ。
I was so nervous.

448
00:51:04,850 --> 00:51:07,310
みんなにも緊張が伝わっててよね。
My nervousness probably got across to everyone too.

449
00:51:07,930 --> 00:51:10,090
緊張もうまく言えな…
I can't even say "nervous" right...

450
00:51:14,390 --> 00:51:16,710
あっ、トレンド1位になったの！
Ah, we reached #1 on trending!

451
00:51:25,770 --> 00:51:27,230
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

452
00:51:31,610 --> 00:51:36,150
と いうわけで、あの…お誕生日配信も…
So, um... the birthday stream too...

453
00:51:36,990 --> 00:51:40,750
終盤に近づいてきたんですけども、えっと…
is coming close to the end, but... um...

454
00:51:42,770 --> 00:51:46,210
いや、感無量すぎて…何も言えない。
Oh, I'm just too overwhelmed with emotion... I can't say anything.

455
00:51:53,510 --> 00:51:58,510
でも、まだ、まだまだ先があるよね！
But we still, still have more to come, right!

456
00:51:59,590 --> 00:52:03,470
みんな、新衣装見たいよね！
Everyone, you want to see the new outfit, right!

457
00:52:06,810 --> 00:52:12,030
と いうわけで、新衣装お披露目の時間だよ！
So, it's time to reveal the new outfit!

458
00:52:13,430 --> 00:52:16,370
みんな、準備はいい？
Everyone, are you ready?

459
00:52:17,930 --> 00:52:21,490
いくよ！せーの！
Here we go! Ready, set!

460
00:52:48,513 --> 00:52:50,273
どう？ちょっと見えた？
How was that? Did you catch a glimpse?

461
00:52:50,693 --> 00:52:53,253
ちょっと見えた？ちょっと見えたよね！
Did you catch a glimpse? You saw a bit, right!

462
00:52:55,513 --> 00:52:59,873
でも、しか見えない。
But you can only see so much.

463
00:53:01,553 --> 00:53:05,653
さあ、おめでとうみんな、ありがとう。
Now, congratulations everyone, thank you.

464
00:53:07,313 --> 00:53:10,333
みんな、見たいって言って！
Everyone, say "I want to see it!"

465
00:53:11,213 --> 00:53:13,293
せーの！
Ready, set!

466
00:53:16,673 --> 00:53:19,613
もっともっと見たい見たい！
We want to see more and more!

467
00:53:22,013 --> 00:53:25,313
聞こえないぞ！見たい！
I can't hear you! We want to see it!

468
00:53:26,913 --> 00:53:32,593
あっ、素晴らしいみんな！では行きますよ！
Ah, wonderful everyone! Here we go!

469
00:53:33,453 --> 00:53:37,513
3、2、1、オープン！
3, 2, 1, open!

470
00:53:43,942 --> 00:53:47,522
はい、ということでどうかな？今回の新衣装です！
So, what do you think? This is my new outfit!

471
00:53:47,802 --> 00:53:59,382
なんとね、これね、あの、テーマが…買って貰えてて…なんて思うテーマ？
You know, the theme for this is... I was told... what kind of theme do you think?

472
00:54:00,822 --> 00:54:04,322
読みますね。モノトーン絶対領域パンツ。
Let me read it. Monotone absolute territory pants.

473
00:54:05,062 --> 00:54:09,302
どういうこと！？どういうことー！
What does that mean!? What does that mean!

474
00:54:10,282 --> 00:54:13,242
というわけで、今回はですね、ちょっとショートヘアに憧れちゃいまして、
So, this time, I've been longing for short hair,

475
00:54:13,242 --> 00:54:22,562
私、ちょっとショートヘアのウィッグを…手に入れちゃいました。
so I got my hands on a short hair wig.

476
00:54:23,422 --> 00:54:26,542
どう？ショートヘア初めてだからちょっと緊張してるんだけど、
How is it? It's my first time with short hair so I'm a bit nervous,

477
00:54:26,962 --> 00:54:31,202
似合うかな？似合うかな？
does it suit me? Does it suit me?

478
00:54:33,962 --> 00:54:42,302
どういうこと？なんてテーマだ。多分これが絶対領域ってことなんじゃないかな。
What does that mean? What kind of theme is that? I guess this is what "absolute territory" means.

479
00:54:42,682 --> 00:55:00,082
でね、他にもいろんなものがあるんですけど、それは配信後のアフターライブメンバー限定で見せちゃおうかなって思ってるから、ぜひそっちも見たいなって人、メンバーに会いに来てくれると嬉しいよ。
And you know, there are various other things too, but I'm thinking of showing those in the member-only after-live stream, so I'd be so happy if those who want to see that come check out the membership.

480
00:55:00,511 --> 00:55:03,611
と言うわけで、新衣装で歌っていこうかなって思います！
So, I thought I'd sing in my new outfit!

481
00:55:04,371 --> 00:55:07,651
ショート似合ってるかな？ドキドキしちゃう。
Does the short hair suit me? I'm getting all nervous.

482
00:55:11,151 --> 00:55:12,491
行きますよー！
Here we go!

483
00:55:13,311 --> 00:55:15,731
エレクトリカル・サーフィン！
Electrical Surfin'!

484
00:55:26,629 --> 00:55:29,789
エレクトリカル・サーフィン サーフィンとか
Electrical Surfin' Surfin' and...

485
00:55:30,269 --> 00:55:35,109
ジャンプとか知ってる人は一緒に言ってね！
If you know the jumps and stuff, say it together!

486
00:55:37,209 --> 00:55:40,609
前略、電子の海は今日も 晴れ、時々雪、ところによりポペ
Dear me, the electronic sea today is sunny, occasionally snow, with parfait here and there.

487
00:55:41,209 --> 00:55:44,889
前人未踏のテラバイト島で まだどこかのあなたを待機中
On the untrodden terabyte island, waiting for you from somewhere else.

488
00:55:44,889 --> 00:55:48,049
偶然だって必然のうち 送受信は見えない糸でしょ
Even a coincidence is part of inevitability, signal transmission and reception are invisible threads, right?

489
00:55:48,049 --> 00:55:51,209
断然こっちがしっくりくるから
Definitely, this side feels more right.

490
00:55:51,209 --> 00:55:53,269
Enter×Space で Escape
Enter×Space to escape.

491
00:55:53,269 --> 00:55:56,709
The Boooom! ここは0と1の楽園
The Boooom! Here is a paradise of 0s and 1s.

492
00:55:56,709 --> 00:56:00,209
The Boooom! 広く深い世界から見つけて
The Boooom! Find it from a wide and deep world.

493
00:56:00,209 --> 00:56:04,449
エレクトリカル・サーフィン サーフィン こちらに来て来て
Electrical Surfin' Surfin' Come on, come over here.

494
00:56:04,449 --> 00:56:08,769
好みも狂いもいただけます
I'll take whatever you like, whether good or crazy.

495
00:56:08,769 --> 00:56:11,949
サーフィン サーフィン 手と手とってって
Surfin' Surfin' Holding hands, taking hands.

496
00:56:11,949 --> 00:56:16,129
白昼夢中 夢中で踊り明かしましょう
Daydreaming, let's dance the night away in a trance.

497
00:56:33,350 --> 00:56:36,770
攻略！電子の海は今日も 赤、青、緑でとにかくいっぱいっぱい
Conquest! The electronic sea today is full of red, blue, and green, packed to the brim.

498
00:56:36,770 --> 00:56:40,190
悠々自適のテラバイト島で お待たせのいつもの開始中
On the leisurely terabyte island, the usual long-awaited activity is starting.

499
00:56:40,190 --> 00:56:43,910
だらしなさこそが至福の時でしょ のんびりでくだらんでだらだらで行こう
The absurdity is the time of supreme bliss, right? Let's go leisurely, loafing around.

500
00:56:43,910 --> 00:56:46,230
Command×Delete で Respawn
Command×Delete to respawn.

501
00:56:46,230 --> 00:56:49,890
The Boooom! ここは雲の向こうの未来
The Boooom! Here is the future beyond the clouds.

502
00:56:49,890 --> 00:56:53,330
The Boooom! 狭く暗いブラウザじゃ物足りないの
The Boooom! A narrow and dark browser isn't satisfying enough.

503
00:56:53,330 --> 00:56:57,370
エレクトリカル・サーフィン サーフィン こちらに来て来て
Electrical Surfin' Surfin' Come on, come over here.

504
00:56:57,370 --> 00:57:01,510
酸いも甘いも忘れてさ
Forget about both acidity and sweetness.

505
00:57:01,510 --> 00:57:05,110
サーフィン サーフィン 手と手とってって
Surfin' Surfin' Holding hands, taking hands.

506
00:57:05,110 --> 00:57:09,310
白昼夢中 夢中にするわ 覚えてて
Daydreaming, I'll make you obsessed, remember that.

507
00:57:09,310 --> 00:57:13,450
エレクトリカル・サーフィン サーフィン こちらを見て見て
Electrical Surfin' Surfin' Look, look over here.

508
00:57:13,450 --> 00:57:17,590
空に輝く奇跡の輪
The circle of miracles shining in the sky.

509
00:57:17,590 --> 00:57:21,250
サーフィン サーフィン 手と手とってって
Surfin' Surfin' Holding hands, taking hands.

510
00:57:21,250 --> 00:57:24,950
Welcome to 夢中で飛べ！飛べ！ 飛べ！飛べ！飛べ！飛べ！
Welcome to, fly in a trance! Fly! Fly! Fly! Fly! Fly!

511
00:57:31,130 --> 00:57:35,230
エレクトリカル・サーフィン サーフィン こちらをみてみて
Electrical Surfin' Surfin' Look, look over here.

512
00:57:35,230 --> 00:57:39,310
宵に輝く奇跡の輪
The circle of miracles shining in the evening.

513
00:57:39,310 --> 00:57:43,250
サーフィン サーフィン 手と手とってって
Surfin' Surfin' Holding hands, taking hands.

514
00:57:43,250 --> 00:57:47,010
Welcome to 夢中で止め！止め！ 止め止め止め止め！
Welcome to stop in a trance! Stop stop stop stop!

515
00:57:47,010 --> 00:57:50,750
エレクトリカル・サーフィン サーフィン こちらに来て来て
Electrical Surfin' Surfin' Come on, come over here.

516
00:57:50,750 --> 00:57:54,690
酸いも甘いも頂きます
I'll take both the sweet and sour.

517
00:57:54,690 --> 00:57:58,530
サーフィン サーフィン 手と手とってって
Surfin' Surfin' Holding hands, taking hands.

518
00:57:58,530 --> 00:58:03,030
白昼夢中 夢中で踊り明かしましょう
Daydreaming, let's dance the night away in a trance.

519
00:58:15,731 --> 00:58:19,611
はい、ということでありがとうございましたー！
Phew, so thank you very much!

520
00:58:29,811 --> 00:58:35,091
いやあ、盛り上がる曲いっぱい踊れるようなね、イメージで
Man, I made the new outfit with the image of songs that get you hyped...

521
00:58:35,591 --> 00:58:43,711
新衣装を作ったので、次のゲストパートでもどんな感じになるかなっていうのを見ていこうと思います。
so let's see how it looks in the next guest part as well.

522
00:58:44,431 --> 00:58:46,111
次が最後のゲストパートです！
The next is the final guest part!

523
00:58:46,311 --> 00:58:49,451
告知を見てくれた人ならわかるよね？
If you saw the announcement, you know who it is, right?

524
00:58:49,711 --> 00:58:51,031
この人たちです！
It's these people!

525
00:59:00,291 --> 00:59:03,391
儒烏風亭らでん / 轟はじめ
Juufutei Raden / Todoroki Hajime

526
00:59:10,291 --> 00:59:14,391
誰もが突然に始まった デタラメなシナリオの上で
Everyone is suddenly starting on a nonsensical scenario.

527
00:59:14,391 --> 00:59:17,791
それは映画のような まるで映画のような どこにでもあるストーリー
It's like a movie, just like in the movies, a story found anywhere.

528
00:59:17,791 --> 00:59:21,191
間違いだらけの道のりだ 丸付けられるのはいくつだ
It's a road full of mistakes, how many can be marked correct?

529
00:59:21,191 --> 00:59:24,591
何が良くないのか どこが良くないのか そこまで教えてくれよ
What's not good? What's wrong with it? Tell me that much.

530
00:59:24,591 --> 00:59:28,291
明け方の妄想 貴重な逃避行と 勘違いの英雄ごっこ もう渋滞してんだ
The delusions at dawn, a precious getaway, acting as the misunderstood hero, we're already in traffic.

531
00:59:28,291 --> 00:59:33,391
どうしようもないどうしようもないよな こんなはずじゃなかったよなって
I can't help it, I can't do anything about it. It wasn't supposed to turn out like this.

532
00:59:33,391 --> 00:59:37,191
どんなはずだったんだよなって 思えば思うほど いやこれじゃないない
What was I supposed to expect? The more I think about it, no, this isn't it.

533
00:59:37,191 --> 00:59:40,191
ハマり悪いよな 向いてないな 今すぐ辞めてしまうか
It's a bad habit, I'm not suited for this, should I just quit right now?

534
00:59:40,191 --> 00:59:43,191
そりゃないない いつになれば僕は 主人公になれるんだろうな
That's not gonna happen, when will I ever become the main character?

535
00:59:43,191 --> 00:59:46,191
足りなくなって笑ったり 増えた荷物数えては泣いたり
Laughing when it's not enough, crying counting extra baggage.

536
00:59:46,191 --> 00:59:49,191
期待するほどでもなくがっかり 責めることすらできず悩んだり
Disappointed it wasn't as expected, troubled because I can't even blame anyone.

537
00:59:49,191 --> 00:59:52,191
爛々と輝く街の灯り 散々だって顔の通りすがり
The city lights shining brilliantly, passing by with a face saying it's all over.

538
00:59:52,191 --> 00:59:55,691
さてどうしようか もう一度 いやこれじゃないない
Now what should I do? Let's do it again, no, this isn't it.

539
00:59:55,691 --> 00:59:59,191
ハマり悪いよな 向いてないな
It's a bad habit, I'm not suited for this...

540
01:00:00,328 --> 01:00:01,648
誰もが突然に始まった
Everyone started all of a sudden

541
01:00:01,648 --> 01:00:03,018
デタラメなシナリオの上で
on a nonsensical scenario.

542
01:00:03,018 --> 01:00:05,198
それは映画のような まるです映画のような
It's like a movie, just like in the movies,

543
01:00:05,198 --> 01:00:06,658
どこにでもあるストーリー
a story that's found anywhere.

544
01:00:06,658 --> 01:00:08,778
間違いだらけの道のりだな
It's a path full of mistakes,

545
01:00:08,888 --> 01:00:10,798
丸投げされるのはいくつだ
how many things are just dumped on us?

546
01:00:26,517 --> 01:00:27,967
何が良いのか
What is good?

547
01:00:27,967 --> 01:00:29,487
何処が良いのか分からない
Where is it good? I don't know,

548
01:00:30,037 --> 01:00:31,957
そこまで教えてくれよ
so tell me that much.

549
01:00:32,067 --> 01:00:33,607
明け方の妄想
Delusions at dawn,

550
01:00:33,607 --> 01:00:35,297
貴重な逃避行と
a precious getaway,

551
01:00:35,297 --> 01:00:37,277
勘違いの英雄ごっこ
and a delusional hero game.

552
01:00:37,277 --> 01:00:39,037
もう鬱屈してんだ
I'm already depressed,

553
01:00:39,037 --> 01:00:41,047
どうしようもこうしようもないよな
there's nothing I can do about it.

554
01:00:41,427 --> 01:00:43,407
これじゃないない
This isn't it,

555
01:00:43,407 --> 01:00:45,227
あまり悪いよな
it's pretty bad, right?

556
01:00:45,227 --> 01:00:47,057
むいてないない
It's not off,

