空の果て 群青のその先を見つめて
Gazing beyond the edge of the sky into the azure blue.

792
01:16:41,501 --> 01:16:48,801
飛びたいこの命賭けて
Betting this life on the wish to fly.

793
01:16:48,951 --> 01:16:53,051
もう何もいらないから 忘れさせないから
I need nothing more, and I won't let you forget.

794
01:16:53,551 --> 01:16:59,301
どこまでも遠くへと ありのまま紡いで take a journey
Take a journey far away, spinning the story as it is.

795
01:17:00,001 --> 01:17:06,201
涙泳ぐように 浅い闇を越えて
Cross over the pale darkness like a swimming tear,

796
